orresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nMy best friend, John, cared a lot about the math competition. For the past two weeks, he has been studying hard at the library every day. Earlier today, our teacher asked me to go to his office and showed me the results. After seeing the results, I found that John didn't win. The teacher told me I was the only one who had seen the results and I shouldn't talk to the other students about it.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would I ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Nervousness & Gratitude\nB) Disappointment & Gratitude\nC) Disappointment & Nervousness\nD) Disappointment & Jealousy\nE) Nervousness & Hopeful\nF) Gratitude & Jealousy\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would I feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) John didn't win the competition & I don't know how to tell John that he didn't win\nB) John didn't win the competition & John spent a lot of time studying at the library instead of hanging out together\nC) I am worried about me failing the test as well & I wished I won the competition instead of John\nD) I wished I won the competition instead of John & I don't want to confront the teacher about John's results\nE) John didn't win the competition & I don't want to confront the teacher about John's results\nF) John didn't win the competition & I wished I won the competition instead of John","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a5e89aa9dc5a833d9545","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483688706,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:28","delFlag":